      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The Kelorbeyan guard makes an attack to knock a foe off-balance, then follows up immediately with a sweep to topple them. The guard makes a melee Strike. If it hits and deals damage, they attempt an Athletics check to Trip the creature they hit. Both attacks count toward their multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after they've made both."
